     - Total: 526ms
     - Query Type: Query
     - Query State: Finished
     - StarRocks Version: main-76cd8d3
     - User: root
     - Default Db: tpch
     - Sql Statement: SELECT 
    p_brand, 
    COUNT(*) AS supplier_count 
FROM 
    partsupp ps 
JOIN 
    part p ON ps.ps_partkey = p.p_partkey 
JOIN 
    supplier s ON ps.ps_suppkey = s.s_suppkey 
GROUP BY 
    p_brand 
ORDER BY 
    supplier_count DESC;
